## Actions

1. (1) Present Exp 2 as a 4-arm 2×2 protocol FROM THE START: rework
   L709 ("The experiment runs two arms…") and L2187 (annex) so the
   2×2 framing (already in tbl:exp2-2x2) leads the presentation. This
   completes what ticket 0567 started.
2. (4) Delete the 2026-05-20 compose-decision sentence (L2066) — noise.
3. (5) Delete the "Test one before blasting" mention (L2106) — noise.
4. (6) Rework Phase A, currently underexplained:
   - introduce a shared sans-serif boxed environment for prompts
     (e.g. a small `promptbox` in the preamble — it will be reused by
     ticket 0590 for the Annex A analysis-cohort prompt);
   - clear crossref to the base prompt rendered in that format;
   - then the metaprompt verbatim, same formatting;
   - the text MUST describe the protocol validation by the models
     themselves — how we iterated, e.g. accommodated their request
     that the harness not be one of the four tested (source from the
     protocol/synopsys files above; do not invent).
5. (7) Remove every Phase C mention — it does not exist. Sites: L694,
   L737, L1085 (sec:discussion), L2013, L2083, L2248, L2307. Note
   L2014 "deferred to post-conference" goes with it (also a promise —
   see sweep ticket 0592).
6. Doc-07 codename: when rewriting these passages, drop the codename
   locally (say "the naive prompt"); the global codename sweep is
   ticket 0591.

